WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.592
First: a credential's subject
has Production, capital P,

3
00:00:05.592 --> 00:00:09.000
where the workflow presents
production, lower case.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.763
What happens when it's
created in Entra I D?

5
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:12.987
The answer is b.

6
00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:16.738
It's created without error, and
the token exchange fails later.

7
00:00:16.738 --> 00:00:19.780
Microsoft Learn's workload
identity federation

8
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.563
documentation says a wrong
subject is created successfully.

9
00:00:23.563 --> 00:00:27.787
The check flags it first,
as N P W I F oh two.

10
00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:30.758
Second: conversion one
ran forty days with no

11
00:00:30.758 --> 00:00:33.888
logon by the old account,
and the owner approved.

12
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:36.288
What does the plan do
with the legacy account?

13
00:00:36.288 --> 00:00:37.513
The answer is b.

14
00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:41.288
It disables it with Disable
A D Account, after review.

15
00:00:41.288 --> 00:00:46.476
This code never deletes it, so the
rollback, enabling it again, stays possible.

16
00:00:46.476 --> 00:00:48.902
The module page has three more questions,

17
00:00:48.902 --> 00:00:51.460
each linked to the
section that answers it.
